@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1/sandbox-game

@adminRole = ADMIN
@adminUserId = 1
@adminUsername = admin

### 管理员：查看指定正式年份汇总
### 若该年份尚未形成有效快照，接口会返回空列表或业务错误，取决于当前库状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-summary/get-year-summary?yearNo=1
X-Role-Type: {{adminRole}}
X-User-Id: {{adminUserId}}
X-Username: {{adminUsername}}

### 管理员：查看最终排名
### 若最终年份尚未满足开放条件，预期返回 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin-summary/get-final-ranking
X-Role-Type: {{adminRole}}
X-User-Id: {{adminUserId}}
X-Username: {{adminUsername}}
